:{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"### Question Description\r\n\r\n```\r\n2022/12/04 16:30:53 INPUT 123 ae7rda8d7asoduasdoiasduasdoi\r\n2022/12/04 16:30:53 CHECK 123 ae7rda8d7asoduasdoiasduasdoi\r\n2022/12/04 16:30:53 no key found\r\n2022/12/04 16:30:53 \r\n2022/12/04 16:30:53 INPUT 123 ae7rda8d7asoduasdoiasduasdoi\r\n2022/12/04 16:30:53 CHECK 123 ae7rda8d7asoduasdoiasduasdoi\r\n2022/12/04 16:30:53 FOUND ae7rda8d7asoduasdoiasduasdoi ae7rda8d7asoduasdoiasduasdoi\r\n2022/12/04 16:30:53 THEY MATCHED!\r\n2022/12/04 16:30:53 \r\n2022/12/04 16:30:53 INPUT 123 ae7rda8d7asoduasdoiasduasdoi\r\n2022/12/04 16:30:53 CHECK 123 ae7rda8d7asoduasdoiasduasdoi\r\n2022/12/04 16:30:53 FOUND ae7rda8d7asoduasdoiasduasdoi lient/projectlist/iasduasdoi\r\n2022/12/04 16:30:53 uID and cVAL do not match\r\n2022/12/04 16:30:53 \r\n2022/12/04 16:31:13 INPUT 123 ae7rda8d7asoduasdoiasduasdoi\r\n2022/12/04 16:31:13 CHECK 123 ae7rda8d7asoduasdoiasduasdoi\r\n2022/12/04 16:31:13 no key found\r\n2022/12/04 16:31:13 \r\n2022/12/04 16:36:21 INPUT 123 ae7rda8d7asoduasdoiasduasdoi\r\n2022/12/04 16:36:21 CHECK 123 ae7rda8d7asoduasdoiasduasdoi\r\n2022/12/04 16:36:21 no key found\r\n2022/12/04 16:36:21 \r\n2022/12/04 16:36:21 INPUT 123 ae7rda8d7asoduasdoiasduasdoi\r\n2022/12/04 16:36:21 CHECK 123 ae7rda8d7asoduasdoiasduasdoi\r\n2022/12/04 16:36:21 no key found\r\n2022/12/04 16:36:21 \r\n2022/12/04 16:36:22 INPUT 123 ae7rda8d7asoduasdoiasduasdoi\r\n2022/12/04 16:36:22 CHECK 123 ae7rda8d7asoduasdoiasduasdoi\r\n2022/12/04 16:36:22 no key found\r\n2022/12/04 16:36:22 \r\n2022/12/04 16:36:22 INPUT 123 ae7rda8d7asoduasdoiasduasdoi\r\n2022/12/04 16:36:22 CHECK 123 ae7rda8d7asoduasdoiasduasdoi\r\n2022/12/04 16:36:22 no key found\r\n2022/12/04 16:36:22 \r\n2022/12/04 16:36:22 INPUT 123 ae7rda8d7asoduasdoiasduasdoi\r\n2022/12/04 16:36:22 CHECK 123 ae7rda8d7asoduasdoiasduasdoi\r\n2022/12/04 16:36:22 FOUND ae7rda8d7asoduasdoiasduasdoi ae7rda8d7asoduasdoiasduasdoi\r\n2022/12/04 16:36:22 THEY MATCHED!\r\n2022/12/04 16:36:22 \r\n2022/12/04 16:36:22 INPUT 123 ae7rda8d7asoduasdoiasduasdoi\r\n2022/12/04 16:36:22 CHECK 123 ae7rda8d7asoduasdoiasduasdoi\r\n2022/12/04 16:36:22 FOUND ae7rda8d7asoduasdoiasduasdoi ae7rda8d7asoduasdoiasduasdoi\r\n2022/12/04 16:36:22 THEY MATCHED!\r\n2022/12/04 16:36:22 \r\n2022/12/04 16:36:36 INPUT 123 ae7rda8d7asoduasdoiasduasdoi\r\n2022/12/04 16:36:36 CHECK 123 ae7rda8d7asoduasdoiasduasdoi\r\n2022/12/04 16:36:36 FOUND ae7rda8d7asoduasdoiasduasdoi ae7rda8d7asoduasdoiasduasdoi\r\n2022/12/04 16:36:36 THEY MATCHED!\r\n2022/12/04 16:36:36 \r\n2022/12/04 16:36:37 INPUT 123 ae7rda8d7asoduasdoiasduasdoi\r\n2022/12/04 16:36:37 CHECK 123 ae7rda8d7asoduasdoiasduasdoi\r\n2022/12/04 16:36:37 no key found\r\n2022/12/04 16:36:37 \r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\nMy syncmap seemingly has random values. I have changed this program several times using pointers and all that but it still has the same conclusion\r\n\r\nbasically you request a page like this `http://127.0.0.1:22403/c/123/73548r3akifuysdf8`\r\nit stores the page and loads the \"123\" and \"73548r3akifuysdf8\" into the sync map using the \"Store\"\r\n\r\nthen the javascript requests a separate function which just loads the syncmap, but \r\n- sometimes the key isn't there \r\n- sometimes it is there\r\n- sometimes it is a different key\r\n\r\nI must be doing something wrong here? I use syncmap in a different fiber project for about a year and it works fine so IDK what this one is doing..\r\n\r\nLook at this, it gets the URL as the value somehow yet my \"INPUT\" was the correct value..?\r\n**I recommend using longer values cuz you get funnier output sometimes**\r\nbut short ones also get changed, it seems to always be URL related the `lient/projectlist` just gets shorter depending how long your value is\r\n\r\nI recommend calling the JS func in the browser too when your page loads with \"THEY MATCH\" because it eventually deletes the value.. it should never delete the key/value there is nothing that does that? I have no deleting at all?\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/50514477/205520625-3dc237a6-6934-4f60-a4f0-b6d8b2d238d8.png)\r\n\r\n\r\n```\r\n2022/12/04 16:40:11 INPUT 123 73548r3akifuysdf8\r\n2022/12/04 16:40:11 CHECK 123 73548r3akifuysdf8\r\n2022/12/04 16:40:11 FOUND 73548r3akifuysdf8 lient/projectlist\r\n2022/12/04 16:40:11 uID and cVAL do not match\r\n2022/12/04 16:40:11 \r\n2022/12/04 16:40:13 INPUT 123 73548r3akifuysdf8\r\n2022/12/04 16:40:13 CHECK 123 73548r3akifuysdf8\r\n2022/12/04 16:40:13 no key found\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nI have rewrote the program as below as short as possible just make a folder \"views\" and folder \"static\" the program should run fine there\r\n\r\n```Go\r\npackage main\r\n\r\nimport (\r\n\t\"embed\"\r\n\t\"log\"\r\n\t\"net/http\"\r\n\t\"sync\"\r\n\t\"time\"\r\n\r\n\t\"github.com/gofiber/fiber/v2\"\r\n\t\"github.com/gofiber/template/html\"\r\n\r\n\t\"github.com/gofiber/fiber/v2/middleware/filesystem\"\r\n)\r\n\r\nvar clientKeys = sync.Map{}\r\n\r\n//go:embed views/*\r\nvar viewsFS embed.FS\r\n\r\n//go:embed static/*\r\nvar staticFS embed.FS\r\n\r\ntype clientAuth struct {\r\n\tCID string `json:\"cid\"`\r\n\tUID string `json:\"uid\"`\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunc main() {\r\n\tengine := html.NewFileSystem(http.FS(viewsFS), \".html\")\r\n\r\n\tclients := fiber.New(fiber.Config{\r\n\t\tCaseSensitive:         true,\r\n\t\tDisableStartupMessage: true,\r\n\t\tServerHeader:          \"\",\r\n\t\tViews:                 engine,\r\n\t})\r\n\t//clients.Use(recover.New())\r\n\r\n\tclients.Use(\"/s\", filesystem.New(filesystem.Config{\r\n\t\tRoot:       http.FS(staticFS),\r\n\t\tBrowse:     false,\r\n\t\tPathPrefix: \"static\",\r\n\t}))\r\n\r\n\tclients.Get(\"/c/:cid/:uid/\", clientPage)\r\n\r\n\tclients.Post(\"/data/client/projectlist/\", projectList)\r\n\r\n\tlog.Fatal(clients.Listen(\":22403\"))\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunc clientPage(c *fiber.Ctx) error {\r\n\tcID := c.Params(\"cid\")\r\n\tuID := c.Params(\"uid\")\r\n\r\n\tlog.Println(\"INPUT\", cID, uID)\r\n\r\n\tclientKeys.Store(cID, uID)\r\n\ttime.Sleep(250 * time.Millisecond)\r\n\r\n\treturn c.Render(\"views/index\", fiber.Map{\r\n\t\t\"CID\": cID,\r\n\t\t\"UID\": uID,\r\n\t})\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunc projectList(c *fiber.Ctx) error {\r\n\tca := new(clientAuth)\r\n\tif err := c.BodyParser(ca); err != nil {\r\n\t\tlog.Println(\"LOGIN PARSER: \", err)\r\n\t\treturn c.SendString(\"Error parsing input.\")\r\n\t}\r\n\r\n\tlog.Println(\"CHECK\", ca.CID, ca.UID)\r\n\tcVal, ok := clientKeys.Load(ca.CID)\r\n\tif !ok {\r\n\t\t//error getting uid? no key set?\r\n\t\tlog.Println(\"no key found\")\r\n\t\tlog.Println(\"\")\r\n\t\tc.SendString(\"no key found\")\r\n\t\treturn c.SendStatus(401)\r\n\t}\r\n\r\n\tlog.Println(\"FOUND\", ca.UID, cVal)\r\n\r\n\tif cVal != ca.UID {\r\n\t\tlog.Println(\"uID and cVAL do not match\")\r\n\t\tlog.Println(\"\")\r\n\t\tc.SendString(\"uID and cVAL do not match\")\r\n\t\treturn c.SendStatus(401)\r\n\t}\r\n\r\n\tlog.Println(\"THEY MATCHED!\")\r\n\tlog.Println(\"\")\r\n\r\n\tlist := `IT WORKS`\r\n\r\n\treturn c.SendString(list)\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nin folder \"static\" `clients.js`\r\n```JavaScript\r\n\r\nconst clientCredentials = function () {\r\n    const c = document.getElementById('clientData');\r\n    const cid = c.getAttribute('data-cid');\r\n    const uid = c.getAttribute('data-uid');\r\n    return [cid, uid];\r\n};\r\n\r\nfunction getProjectList() {\r\n    const pl = document.getElementById('projectList');\r\n    pl.innerHTML = \"loading\";\r\n    const cc = clientCredentials();\r\n    fetch(\"/data/client/projectlist/\", {\r\n        method: 'POST',\r\n        headers: {\r\n            'Content-Type': 'application/json'\r\n        },\r\n        body: JSON.stringify({ cid: cc[0], uid: cc[1] })\r\n    })\r\n    .then(response => {\r\n            return response.text();\r\n    })\r\n    .then(data => {\r\n        pl.innerHTML = data;\r\n    })\r\n    .catch((error) => {\r\n        pl.innerHTML = error;\r\n    });\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\nwindow.addEventListener(\"load\", function () {\r\n    getProjectList();\r\n}, false);\r\n```\r\n\r\nin folder \"views\" `index.html`\r\n```html\r\n<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html lang=\"en\">\r\n<head>\r\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\r\n    <script defer src=\"/s/clients.js\"></script>\r\n</head>\r\n\r\n<body>\r\n    <div id=\"projectList\">\r\n    </div>\r\n    <br>\r\n    {{.CID}}\r\n    <br>\r\n    {{.UID}}\r\n    <div class=\"d-none\" id=\"clientData\" data-cid=\"{{.CID}}\" data-uid=\"{{.UID}}\"></div>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Code Snippet (optional)\r\n\r\n_No response_\r\n\r\n### Checklist:\r\n\r\n- [X] I agree to follow Fiber's [Code of Conduct](https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/blob/master/.github/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md).\r\n- [X] I have checked for existing issues that describe my questions prior to opening this one.\r\n- [X] I understand that improperly formatted questions may be closed without explanation.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gofiber/fiber/issues/2260/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gofiber/fiber/issues/2260/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]